; BULWARK's cover (design ruling 5): SOFT (Lancer.COVER 1) against incoming attacks, on each allied
; character within Range 3 of a Pier carrying buff_bulwark_gate. Balor's buff_hive_frenzy_cover_aura
; shape. Cover is max-then-zero (cover_calculator.gd:19-24, :56-62): soft is a floor, hard terrain
; still wins, and only weapon attacks read cover (attack_roll.gd:153-169). VISIBLE - the chip on the
; sheltered ally is the trait's on-map sign; it wears the Kit's glyph family (SP3).
[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_cover")
; YIELDING BuffCover (2026-10-02): stands down while the holder already has cover at least as good
; from another COVER buff, so House Guard 3 (talents mod) still counts one cover buff per source.
; No change in play - see buff_cover_yielding.gd.
cover = 1
to = &"cover"
icon = ExtResource("2_icon")
